'''Rocky''' is a [[Humans|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found near the Cooking Table at [[Farnum's Farm]], located in the [[Southern Wilds]]. He sells exclusively [[Brawler]] [[Jobs|Job]] [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*Bell Brawler Shoulderpads
*Bell Brawler Pants
*Bell Brawler Bandana
*Bell Brawler Gloves
*Bell Brawler Boots
*Bell Brawler Shirt
*[[Brawler's Mallet of Sweeps]]

==Trivia==
*Rocky was introduced in-game on August 6, 2013.
